# Market research pipeline. Install with `crontab -e` and paste these lines (fix the path if needed).
# Times are the machine's local time: set it to Prague first (sudo timedatectl set-timezone Europe/Prague).
# Mon-Fri mornings cover every US close from Friday to Thursday; Monday morning also does the weekly full review.
#
# m  h  dom mon dow  command
30   7  *   *   1-5  /home/boobogo/coding/investment/scripts/run_pipeline.sh morning
0    15 *   *   1-5  /home/boobogo/coding/investment/scripts/run_pipeline.sh preopen
